    ...     choicelist[1],
    ...     jnp.where(condlist[2],
    ...       choicelist[2],
    ...       default)))
    Array([ 10,   2, 300,   0], dtype=int32)

    However, for efficiency it is implemented in terms of :func:`jax.lax.select_n`.

